      "text": "14. At first, sand has to be filtered. $\\mathrm{CCl}_4$ has to be\nseparated by using separating funnel. Then,\nfractional crystallization is done to sepa-\nrate $\\mathrm{KNO}_3$. To separate NaCl, evaporation is\nrequired."
